### Large source assets — the app ships optimised copies instead ───────────
# Original 1400x320 / 520KB email banner. The version actually attached to report
# emails is the resized 129KB copy at src/main/resources/email/email-footer-banner.png,
# which IS committed (it has to be on the classpath at runtime). Keeping the heavy
# original out of the repo avoids carrying 520KB that nothing reads.
docs/email_bottom_photo.png
deploy/api.env
deploy/preview/preview.env
deploy/*.pem

# AutoXing cloud dashboard screenshots (Statistics / Task pages), saved as PDFs for
# reference while designing the delivery report. ~4.7 MB that nothing in the build
# reads; they stay on disk locally, out of the repo.
docs/autoxing/*.pdf
